The host imports the loader encoding and transport from a separate checkout:
https://github.com/BlackLikeaCat/actions-adfu-tool/tree/91c8f4709c5d36f916baa2109900df6b95dc396f

From the repository root, rebuild the shipped handler with GNU binutils:

    mipsel-linux-gnu-as -EL -mips32r2 -o patches/keymode-v3.o patches/keymode-v3.S
    mipsel-linux-gnu-objcopy -O binary -j .text patches/keymode-v3.o patches/keymode-v3.bin

The binary contains the assembled key handler. The tool copies the displaced
instructions from the user's stock VIDEO.APP into the handler when preparing
the on-device payload.
